  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">奇幻村莊城市</span></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\">一張大型創意地圖，擁有巨型建築與奇幻設定。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\">具備絕佳場景設定，無論獨自或與朋友同遊，都能提供數小時探索所需的一切。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\">沉浸於可自由進出城堡、浮空島與小屋的世界，無限制地建造你的基地。</span>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>專案進度：</strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\">專案持續進行未來更新中。</span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em>地圖預覽：</em></span></h1><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c97811c8-50e6-4473-a976-ed1d3273d77c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0f5623ad-b029-41c0-935c-8871394bbf04.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_55a28a00-223c-4b5d-8bf2-c7abe2a577c5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a2392ef1-5104-42fd-90b0-85c23e272663.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_49b54391-8b80-4352-9100-40d55ec576da.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6b78cb39-09c1-4416-97b9-2abe0e6b1fe7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d1826abb-a5f5-488d-9ff5-3d0d5d4873f2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_52191e3a-9542-4c12-892f-2daddeced4b6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a3363cb4-41a6-449b-8728-83916cb57f05.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_43ef8e53-b489-4af2-86ad-e334bc24765e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67c843a7-f346-45cd-b54b-f0d1fb69cb0e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2262b478-025d-46fc-9d32-19e2f6167009.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d2c3147-a1d5-405d-b91b-5c0316acd15c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5e0e3324-611b-40a6-9c5b-56403d5152d4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0ea90f4a-018a-4641-8ebb-6b58722cfb83.jpg\" alt=\"\"></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">實際建築數量遠超圖示內容</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">盡情探索發掘所有秘密</span></p>",
